  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Triple Artemisinin Combination Therapies to accelerate the development of two new malaria therapies.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development of Triple Artemisinin-based Combination Therapies (DeTACT) project aims to provide a strategy using currently available drugs to protect present first-line antimalarials, to contain and effectively treat multidrug-resistant Plasmodium falciparum malaria in the Greater Mekong Sub region, and to prevent or delay antimalarial drug resistance in India, Africa, and beyond.</narrative>
  </description>
